    "title": "Autoregressive Model Beats Diffusion: Llama for Scalable Image Generation",
    "citation": "Peize Sun et al., 2024",
    "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.06525",
    "authors": "Peize Sun; Yi Jiang; Shoufa Chen; Shilong Zhang; Bing-Yue Peng; Ping Luo; Zehuan Yuan",
